//! The sort package: a permutation that orders a row of integer keys,
//! stable, built from a prefix fold and a scatter.
//!
//! A scene sorts to find what is near what — a grid cell as the key
//! puts the things in a cell side by side — or to draw in an order the
//! picture depends on. What comes out is the permutation; the rows it
//! orders are read through it.
package sort@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
